msgid "Feature Activation"
msgstr "Features activeren"

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/FeatureActivationSettings.php:91
msgid "Here you can enable and disable the modules and features in this plugin. Refreshing this list, will perform a scan that automatically detect new modules and features if there are any. By default new modules and features will be disabled en need to be enabled to launch them."
msgstr "Hier zet je de modules en features van deze plugin aan en uit. Vernieuwen voert een scan uit die nieuwe modules en features vindt. Nieuwe modules en features staan standaard uit en moeten eerst worden aangezet."

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/FeatureActivationSettings.php:167
msgid "Select all"
msgstr "Alles selecteren"

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/FeatureActivationSettings.php:221
msgid "Available features:"
msgstr "Beschikbare features:"

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/FeatureActivationSettings.php:465
msgid "All modules and features where reset to their default settings."
msgstr "Alle modules en features zijn teruggezet naar hun standaardinstellingen."

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/FeatureActivationSettings.php:498
msgid "Critical Error: Failed to find modules and features in scan. Is this correct?"
msgstr "Kritieke fout: de scan vond geen modules en features. Klopt dat?"

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/FeatureActivationSettings.php:502
msgid "Scan was succesful. All Modules and Features succesfully registered."
msgstr "Scan geslaagd. Alle modules en features zijn geregistreerd."

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/FeatureActivationSettings.php:533
msgid "Scan for new features"
msgstr "Zoeken naar nieuwe features"

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/OptionsManagementSettings.php:106
msgid "Review unmapped feature settings inside the Quarantine pool. Choose to transport them in bulk to standalone or grouped database keys, or delete them permanently from the system."
msgstr "Bekijk feature-instellingen zonder vaste plek in de quarantainepool. Verplaats ze in één keer naar losse of gegroepeerde databaseopties, of verwijder ze definitief."

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/OptionsManagementSettings.php:180
msgid "Please provide a custom destination option name."
msgstr "Geef een naam op voor de doeloptie."

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/OptionsManagementSettings.php:195
msgid "Critical Error: You do not have sufficient permissions to modify the Options Vault."
msgstr "Kritieke fout: je hebt onvoldoende rechten om de optiekluis te wijzigen."

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/OptionsManagementSettings.php:201
msgid "Security Check Failed: The security token has expired or is invalid. Please refresh and try again."
msgstr "Beveiligingscontrole mislukt: het beveiligingstoken is verlopen of ongeldig. Vernieuw de pagina en probeer het opnieuw."

