msgstr "Kies een actie voor de geselecteerde tokens:"

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/OptionsManagementSettings.php:563
msgid "↩️ De-register: Move tokens back to Quarantine pool"
msgstr "↩️ Afmelden: tokens terug naar de quarantainepool"

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/OptionsManagementSettings.php:564
msgid "Select all active features tokens across all blocks"
msgstr "Alle actieve feature-tokens in alle blokken selecteren"

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/OptionsManagementSettings.php:595
msgid "Danger Zone Panel Area"
msgstr "Gevarenzone"

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/OptionsManagementSettings.php:596
msgid "Erase Configuration Strategy: Select feature settings tokens via checkboxes across either list above to submit them for hard erasure. Applying the button action inside the footer below will permanently scrub the keys and clear out data structures directly from the WordPress database rows context allocations."
msgstr "Instellingen wissen: selecteer met de vinkjes in een van de lijsten hierboven de tokens die je wilt wissen. De knop hieronder verwijdert die opties en hun gegevens definitief uit de database."

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/OptionsManagementSettings.php:613
msgid "Add keys to options"
msgstr "Sleutels aan opties toevoegen"

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/OptionsManagementSettings.php:614
msgid "Remove keys from options"
msgstr "Sleutels uit opties verwijderen"

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/OptionsManagementSettings.php:615
msgid "Permanently Erase Options"
msgstr "Opties definitief wissen"

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/OptionsManagementSettings.php:616
msgid "CRITICAL WARNING: Are you absolutely certain you want to permanently erase the selected tokens and all their entries from storage? This action cannot be reverted."
msgstr "BELANGRIJKE WAARSCHUWING: weet je zeker dat je de geselecteerde tokens en al hun gegevens definitief wilt wissen? Dit kan niet ongedaan worden gemaakt."

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/OptionsManagementSettings.php:656
msgid "No Tokens were selected. Please select the quarantine tokens you want processed."
msgstr "Er zijn geen tokens geselecteerd. Selecteer de quarantainetokens die je wilt verwerken."

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/OptionsManagementSettings.php:661
msgid "Please select an action you want to perform on the tokens you selected."
msgstr "Kies de actie die je op de geselecteerde tokens wilt uitvoeren."

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/OptionsManagementSettings.php:673
msgid "Bulk Action Failed: Target destination key cannot be empty."
msgstr "Bulkactie mislukt: de doeloptie mag niet leeg zijn."

#. translators: %d: number of moved tokens.
#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/OptionsManagementSettings.php:688
#, php-format
msgid "Bulk transport complete! %d feature tokens successfully moved to active storage destinations."
msgstr "Verplaatsen voltooid! %d feature-tokens zijn naar hun opslagplek verplaatst."

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/OptionsManagementSettings.php:700
msgid "Bulk Action Failed: No active features tokens were selected for processing."
msgstr "Bulkactie mislukt: er zijn geen actieve feature-tokens geselecteerd."

#. translators: %d: number of keys.
#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/OptionsManagementSettings.php:719
#, php-format
msgid "%d keys successfully de-registered and safely returned to quarantine via the Vault."
msgstr "%d sleutels afgemeld en via de kluis teruggezet in quarantaine."

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/OptionsManagementSettings.php:740
msgid "Deep Purge Failed: No tokens were checked from either section lists."
msgstr "Wissen mislukt: er zijn in geen van beide lijsten tokens aangevinkt."

#. translators: %d: number of erased configurations.
#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/OptionsManagementSettings.php:757
#, php-format
msgid "Deep Purge Completed! %d configurations tokens and data structures fully erased from the database."
msgstr "Wissen voltooid! %d instellingen en hun gegevens zijn uit de database verwijderd."

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/PushNoticeSettings.php:118
msgid "Push Notice Services"
msgstr "Pushmeldingen"

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/PushNoticeSettings.php:129
msgid "Select a service you want to send the automatic push notices to, that are sent to inform you of problems with the website, and set the authentication data to connect the driver to the service."
msgstr "Kies de dienst waar automatische pushmeldingen over problemen met de website naartoe gaan, en vul de gegevens in om de driver met die dienst te verbinden."

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/PushNoticeSettings.php:202
msgid "The selected push notice service driver class does not exist."
msgstr "De gekozen driver voor pushmeldingen bestaat niet."

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/PushNoticeSettings.php:220
msgid "Critical Error: You do not have sufficient permissions to modify push notice settings."
msgstr "Kritieke fout: je hebt onvoldoende rechten om de instellingen voor pushmeldingen te wijzigen."

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/PushNoticeSettings.php:225
msgid "Save Failed: No valid active messaging driver payload was submitted."
msgstr "Opslaan mislukt: er is geen geldige driver meegestuurd."

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/PushNoticeSettings.php:249
msgid "Push notice configuration successfully updated."
msgstr "Instellingen voor pushmeldingen bijgewerkt."

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/PushNoticeSettings.php:265
msgid "Active Messaging Service"
msgstr "Actieve meldingsdienst"

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/PushNoticeSettings.php:266
msgid "-- None (Deactivated) --"
msgstr "-- Geen (uitgeschakeld) --"

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/PushNoticeSettings.php:267
msgid "Select the platform where automated push notice notifications should be transmitted to."
msgstr "Kies het platform waar automatische pushmeldingen naartoe gaan."

